<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Fitzwilton 96 pre-tax profit 15.1 mln punts.</title>
<headline>Fitzwilton 96 pre-tax profit 15.1 mln punts.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			  (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		4.01		   vs 4.26</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.35		   vs 1.3</p>
<p> Total dividend	   2.45		   vs 2.35</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    15.11		  vs 15.03</p>
<p> Turnover		   319.73		 vs 305.13</p>
<p>NOTE - Fitzwilton Plc is an industrial holding group whose principal interests are in Northern Irish retail chain Wellworths and in crystal and fine china group Waterford Wedgwood Plc.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom + 353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
